                     framing from https://github.com/phuryn/pm-skills, whose
                     pm-ai-shipping and pm-product-discovery skills attribute
                     those in turn to Teresa Torres, Dan Olsen and Alberto
                     Savoia. Nothing is copied verbatim: the evidence classes,
                     the two-axis rule, the artifact shape and the scorecard are
